# A faithful seed Galois realization contains a full-order character value

Theorem statement: `HorizontalPadicL.SeedCyclotomicGaloisCharacterDataV2.exists_fullOrder_value_v2`
(`9606b52a-0137-48ed-adb7-fbb513d1c658`), by davidloeffler, 2026-09-25.

Proof: submission `7e21a5fb-c56c-4fb1-97e7-c49eae9feb07`, by davidloeffler, 2026-09-25 (ACCEPTED);
locally adapted.

A faithful seed/cyclotomic Galois realization contains a unit residue class a such that eta(a) has
the full order of eta.

## Explanation of the source proof

The seed-character homomorphism in the bundled Galois realization is faithful and its distinguished
generator maps to a generator of the finite cyclic image of the seed Dirichlet character. The
realization's compatibility with the Dirichlet character supplies a residue class whose character
value is that generator. Its order is therefore exactly the order of the seed character.

